{"id": "Df8B7lczNZo", "title": "Video by fatfendergarage", "description": "The Train, one click at a time. \n\nBillet knobs for the headlights and glove box, a Vintage Air panel with billet levers, heated and cooled seats, and a 4WD dial you can hear click through 2H, 4H and 4L. Plus two super rad cup holders that fold out of the front and back bench seats from the talented folks at @santanainteriordesign \n\nUnder all of it is our FFX, the new name for our 4x4 chassis. It fits ‘61–‘79 Ford 4x4s, ‘66–‘79 Broncos and ‘67–‘72 Chevy C10 and Blazer 4x4s.\n\nTap the link in our bio and our team will spec one for your truck.", "channel": "fatfendergarage", "uploader_id": "1689907668", "uploader": "FAT FENDER GARAGE", "timestamp": 1795123467, "like_count": 10574, "comment_count": 72, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1136396945463550a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 98.621, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP-GlSYXTNjJGYbvSwhvj38I8ZBLyuhttXMeairFwiKaUEYV5aLDbtjla1zyRiwjQdvAIltZzFUpRicOj8IKqsO_yz_NpfaajS6BzM.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=0dDy4GSUQk8Q7kNvwG5iwEF&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=aBxeRt9jNcB24zdR9wYzUQ&_nc_ss=7a580&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&_nc_enc=Un5Vz5Luc_BHk-kq47Om6ziBjFDhRDTXuubSlINYc3cWYVkwbCKcb0lIwzPB1Si2vdWPixzWV1niFl9d5bTUw6BV8aXwc_BvIwr9HABvJx2yltBrnfID-MW1eF4&oh=00_AQQ59crbFUKvO54fSMj5kpgTtnR_WdyBath63RyMLSjXZA&oe=6B03ADF9", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 98.621, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Lan